    "id": "asagaya-shinmeigu",
    "category": "shrine",
    "name": {
     "en": "Asagaya Shinmei-gū",
     "ja": "阿佐ヶ谷神明宮"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "The guardian shrine of old Asagaya village. Its sacred object is a stone brought back from the Miyagawa River at Ise in the 1190s, and Asagaya-bayashi festival music, handed down since the late Edo period, is played on its Noh stage at the autumn festival.",
     "ja": "旧阿佐ヶ谷村の鎮守。1190年代に伊勢の宮川から持ち帰られた霊石を御神体とする。秋の例大祭では、江戸後期から伝わる阿佐谷囃子が能楽殿で奉納される。"
    },
