     "ja": "杉並猿田彦神社"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Its kami was brought from Tsubaki Ōkami Yashiro in Mie, regarded as Sarutahiko's head shrine. As the kami who leads the way, Sarutahiko draws people praying before building work and new ventures, and for business.",
     "ja": "三重県の椿大神社（猿田彦大神の総本宮とされる）から勧請した。道を開く神として、地鎮祭や方位除け、商売繁盛を願う人々が訪れる。"
